Z||000003||theogre||12-29-2000||04:43 PM||||Ain't gonna happen. you need to build an interface to convert VGA into the signals for the flat panel. Laptop computers use graphics chips specifically designed to talk to the panel directly. A PC can't do this.||||reg||1
